@startuml stm_primary
' SysML State Machine Diagram
' Primary state machine for the metersetmap orchestrator (orchestration-first
' build). Shows ONLY user-receptive states (init / configuring / idle_* /
' modal / displaying / error_*). The 5 input-method sub-LTSs are collapsed
' to a single `idle_<role>_method_dispatched(Method)` super-state per role,
' annotated with "see input_method_stubs.pl (DEFERRED -- Phase 2 expansion)".
' Internal-trace states (computing_*) appear as notes on the
' click(run_calculation_button) transition; their decomposition is in
' act_compute_pipeline.svg.

title <<stm>> metersetmap -- Primary State Machine (orchestration-first)

top to bottom direction

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor<<init>>      #e8eaf6
    BorderColor<<init>>          #283593
    FontColor<<init>>            #1a237e

    BackgroundColor<<idle>>      #e3f2fd
    BorderColor<<idle>>          #1565c0
    FontColor<<idle>>            #0d47a1

    BackgroundColor<<displaying>> #f9fbe7
    BorderColor<<displaying>>     #827717
    FontColor<<displaying>>       #827717

    BackgroundColor<<modal>>     #e0f2f1
    BorderColor<<modal>>         #00695c
    FontColor<<modal>>           #004d40

    BackgroundColor<<error>>     #fce4ec
    BorderColor<<error>>         #c62828
    FontColor<<error>>           #b71c1c

    BackgroundColor<<sidelts>>   #f3e5f5
    BorderColor<<sidelts>>       #6a1b9a
    FontColor<<sidelts>>         #4a148c
}

' ============================================================
' States (user-receptive only)
' ============================================================

[*] --> init

state "init" as init <<init>>
init : First execution at PY:571
init : All widgets at constructor defaults

state "configuring_mode" as configuring_mode <<idle>>
configuring_mode : Config Mode radio rendered
configuring_mode : config loaded from TOML

state "Wizard: data selection" as DataSelection {
    state "idle_reference_selecting_method" as idle_ref_select <<idle>>
    idle_ref_select : Advanced mode only;\nin non-advanced, dispatch is\nimplicit on first render

    state "idle_reference_method_dispatched" as idle_ref_dispatched <<idle>>
    idle_ref_dispatched : DEFERRED sub-LTS\nsee input_method_stubs.pl\nMethod in {dicom, icom, trf,\n  mosaiq, monaco}

    state "idle_evaluation_selecting_method" as idle_eval_select <<idle>>
    idle_eval_select : Same shape as Reference

    state "idle_evaluation_method_dispatched" as idle_eval_dispatched <<idle>>
    idle_eval_dispatched : DEFERRED sub-LTS\nsees reference_results
}

state "Output config" as OutputConfig {
    state "configuring_output_escan" as cfg_escan <<idle>>
    cfg_escan : st_misc.get_site_and_directory\nPY:722

    state "configuring_output_png" as cfg_png <<idle>>
    cfg_png : Advanced only; text_input\nPY:746-748
}

state "ready_to_calculate" as ready <<idle>>
ready : both_results_present\nAND output_config_complete\nRun Calculation button armed

state "modal_warning_metersetmap_usage" as modal_warn <<modal>>
modal_warn : st.warning(WARNING_MESSAGE)\nPY:771\nFirst-class modal state

state "displaying_results" as displaying <<displaying>>
displaying : st.pyplot(fig) rendered\nPDF download <a href> emitted\nfig + 4 PNGs saved to disk

state "Errors" as ErrorTier {
    state "error_pdf_conversion" as err_pdf <<error>>
    err_pdf : magick + convert both fail\nUnableToCreatePDF rendered\nPY:553-568

    state "error_config_missing" as err_cfg <<error>>
    err_cfg : KeyError on iCOM/TRF\nbackup config; sidebar.write\nPY:111-116

    state "error_file_not_found_baseline" as err_baseline <<error>>
    err_baseline : Advanced debugging only\nimageio.imread fail\nPY:411-431
}

state "Sidebar side-LTS" as SidebarLts {
    state "viewing_icom_status" as view_icom <<sidelts>>
    view_icom : Per-linac iCOM scan rendered\nPY:128-129

    state "viewing_trf_status" as view_trf <<sidelts>>
    view_trf : Per-linac TRF scan rendered\nPY:137-138
}

state "Advanced debugging" as AdvancedDebug {
    state "comparing_baseline_to_output" as comp_baseline <<sidelts>>
    comp_baseline : Per-image imageio.imread\n+ np.allclose loop

    state "displaying_baseline_diff" as display_baseline <<sidelts>>
    display_baseline : Comparison results rendered
}

' ============================================================
' Transitions
' ============================================================

init                  -down->  configuring_mode             : init

configuring_mode      -down->  idle_ref_select              : select(config_mode, M)\n[any user-receptive]

idle_ref_select       -down->  idle_ref_dispatched          : select(reference_method, M)\n[advanced_mode]\n  OR\n  input_method_returned(reference, M, R)

idle_ref_dispatched   -down->  idle_eval_select             : input_method_returned(reference, M, R)\n[reference_results stored;\n derive_state evaluates next tier]

idle_eval_select      -down->  idle_eval_dispatched         : select(evaluation_method, M)\n  OR\n  input_method_returned(evaluation, M, R)

idle_eval_dispatched  -down->  cfg_escan                    : input_method_returned(evaluation, M, R)

cfg_escan             -down->  cfg_png                      : select(escan_site, S)\n[advanced_mode]
cfg_escan             -down->  ready                        : select(escan_site, S)\n[NOT advanced_mode]
cfg_png               -down->  ready                        : text_change(png_output_directory, P)

ready                 -down->  modal_warn                   : click(run_calculation_button)\n[can_run_calculation]\n/ {render warning}

modal_warn            -down->  displaying                   : (same rerun;\n  modal is render-only;\n  pipeline runs through to results)\n/ {compute_ref_msm,\n   compute_eval_msm,\n   compute_gamma,\n   compute_plot,\n   plt_savefig,\n   subprocess(magick) -- success}

modal_warn            -right-> err_pdf                      : (same rerun)\n/ {compute completes;\n   subprocess(magick) AND\n   subprocess(convert) BOTH fail\n   -> render UnableToCreatePDF}

' Re-running with new inputs
displaying            -up->    idle_ref_select              : (any user event\n  not click(run_calculation))
err_pdf               -up->    idle_ref_select              : (any user event)

' Sidebar side-LTS (independent of main wizard)
configuring_mode      -right-> view_icom                    : click(status_check_button)\n/ {scan iCOM dirs}
view_icom             -down->  view_trf                     : (same rerun)\n/ {scan TRF backup tree}
view_trf              -up->    configuring_mode             : (any other event)

configuring_mode      -right-> err_cfg                      : click(status_check_button)\n[KeyError on config]\n/ {render ConfigMissing}
err_cfg               -up->    configuring_mode             : (any user event)

' Advanced debugging side-LTS
ready                 -right-> comp_baseline                : click(compare_baseline_button)\n[advanced_mode]\n/ {iterate baseline PNGs}
comp_baseline         -down->  display_baseline             : (same rerun;\n  imageio.imread + np.allclose loop\n  completes successfully)
comp_baseline         -right-> err_baseline                 : (same rerun;\n  imageio.imread fails for\n  some output PNG)
display_baseline      -up->    ready                        : (any other event)
err_baseline          -up->    ready                        : (any other event)

' Advanced mode toggle works from any state
note "toggle(advanced_mode, Bool) is legal\nfrom every user-receptive state.\nIt does NOT change the tier directly;\nit gates the legality of\nselect(<role>_method, ...) and\ntext_change(png_output_directory, ...)\nin subsequent steps." as N_advanced

' ============================================================
' Notes
' ============================================================

note right of idle_ref_dispatched
    [DEFERRED -- Phase 2 expansion]
    The 5 input-method sub-LTSs (DICOM, iCOM, TRF, Mosaiq, Monaco) each have
    rich internal state machines:
      * DICOM:   FILE_UPLOAD vs MONACO_SEARCH radio, SOPClassUID gate,
                 fraction-group selector, 3 distinct error_wrong_dicom_type states
      * iCOM:    patient_id text, multiselect, error_input_required
      * TRF:     FILE_UPLOAD vs INDEXED_TRF_SEARCH radio, multiselect,
                 Mosaiq patient-name lookup sub-pipeline
      * Mosaiq:  site picker, patient_id, get_patient_name + get_patient_fields
                 cache hits, field_id multiselect
      * Monaco:  delegated to st_monaco.monaco_tel_files_picker;
                 NoControlPointsFound error
    See input_method_stubs.pl docstring for the per-method internal
    state inventory.
end note

note right of modal_warn
    The click(run_calculation_button) transition visits these
    INTERNAL-TRACE STATES sequentially within a single rerun:
      computing_reference_metersetmap
        -> computing_per_delivery(reference, I)  (per ref delivery)
      -> computing_evaluation_metersetmap
        -> computing_per_delivery(evaluation, I) (per eval delivery)
      -> computing_gamma
      -> computing_plot
      -> computing_png_save
      -> computing_pdf_convert
      -> displaying_results | error_pdf_conversion
    See act_compute_pipeline.svg for the decomposition.
    Internal-trace states are NOT user-event-receptive.
end note

@enduml
